status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MAEDA NAOKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANO YOSHIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIBA MAHITO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKUMOTO YOSHITOMO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KANDA, KOJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOTAKA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MAEDA, NAOKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANO, YOSHIAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIBA, MAHITO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKUMOTO, YOSHITOMO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A steering device or torque detector comprises a rotation angle detector, which includes a rotating body having magnetically discontinuous parts in its axial and peripheral directions and a magnetic sensor for detecting an axial position where a magnetic change occurs on th surface of the rotating body in response to its rotation. On the basis of the position detected by the magnetic sensor, the angle of rotation of the rotating body is detected with respect to the magnetic sensor. This angle detector is free of sliding parts, thus increasing durability.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un levier de direction ou un détecteur de couple comprenant un détecteur d'angle de rotation qui comporte un dispositif rotatif possédant des segments à discontinuité magnétique dans les directions axiale et périphérique et un détecteur magnétique destiné à détecter une position axiale dans laquelle se produit une variation magnétique à la surface du dispositif rotatif en réponse à sa rotation. Sur la base de la position détectée par le détecteur magnétique, l'angle de rotation du dispositif rotatif est détecté par rapport au détecteur magnétique. Ce détecteur d'angle est exempt de parties coulissantes, ce qui augmente sa durabilité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>